> [H]omer is[ back] and is crazier than ever. He continues his killing spree in this Simpsons crazed shooting game. You get to kill the whole gang in this game, Bart, Lisa, Marge, Ned Flanders, Rod Flanders, Tod Flanders, Police Chief Wiggum, Barney, Moe, Dr Nick Riviera, and many more.[][][][][][][]

