> [Ev]oly is a cute match three game that lets you create your own World of cute little critters!
Make fast matches and clear the board to earn money to spend on creating your very own world of cute creatures, plants and more. Experiment with over 150 unique characters.
Watch your creation into a bustling new environment packed with fuzzy animals all created by you. Download and play Evoly now for free!
Create your own cute creatures![][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]

